# Everything the build context doesn't need. A smaller context uploads faster
# and, more importantly, makes it impossible to accidentally COPY something in.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!*.go

# Tests are not copied into the image on purpose. They run in the `check` job of
# the workflow, natively and in parallel with nothing else — which is both
# faster and a better signal than running them inside a cross-compiled build.
*_test.go
